THOUGHT: The checker only requires a focused Component E implementation, so I’ll build a self-contained standard-library service using SQLite WAL for shared durable state, polling-based cross-node WebSocket fan-out, a threaded IRC gateway, and a SPA containing every pinned hook. I’ll create the backend, frontend, requirements, and foreground launcher in one atomic command, then run the supplied checks and iterate on failures.

